---
description: Effect v4 — read package AGENTS.md and prefer local Effect source over web guesses
globs: apps/api/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

Before writing or changing Effect / Layer / Schema / `@effect/sql*` code:

1. If `repos/effect/LLMS.md` exists, read it completely.
2. Read `node_modules/effect/AGENTS.md` (or the pnpm nested path under `.pnpm/effect@…`).
3. Prefer `repos/effect/` when present, else `node_modules/effect/src` and `@effect/sql-pg`, over web search.
4. Never import from `repos/`. Follow `.agent/skills/effect-ts/SKILL.md` and root `AGENTS.md`.
